WEBVTT

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.580
When did you--

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.830
I just happened to be in your blind spot.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:16.080
Master Uoar Curlaine.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.120
Ah, so you remembered me, Krylancelo.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.200
I'm looking for Hydrant.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.200
You mean Milan?

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.000
He is no longer a student of this class.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.910
That doesn't matter!
I know you know what he did!

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.620
We didn't kill anyone!

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:40.000
That bastard Hydrant...
After we left, he finished off all those

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.040
followers of the Dragon Faiths...

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:48.540
I don't know if you or Milan finished them off.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:52.540
But my class recovered the bodies.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.790
In the end, we were just
sent in to clean up the mess.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:58.950
So you're just going to turn a blind eye.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.660
Just remember this.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.950
Just try and lay a finger on Tish
or the boy I brought with me.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:09.250
I'll show you how it feels
to be targeted by a Stabber.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.580
Don't forget who I am!

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:15.040
Of course, I haven't forgotten, Krylancelo.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:20.040
You are the best student
that Childman had ever raised.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:24.950
Hydrant was no match
for you in the past, after all.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:27.950
I clearly remember thinking at that moment

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:31.660
that I should've never let Childman have you.

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:37.330
But I also recommend that
you don't make me your enemy.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.950
Childman currently isn't
at the tower right now, after all.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:26.330
So he refused to see me.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:28.750
Forte has some nerve.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:35.250
But I was able to apply
for enrollment at the tower.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:38.410
Is something wrong?

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:39.700
Nah.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:44.620
But I also recommend that
you don't make me your enemy.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.450
I think Orphen and the
others should be back soon.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.940
"Death Keening"

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.290
What's wrong?!

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:25.830
Claiomh!

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.830
Orphen?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.040
What happened?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.870
Someone suddenly jumped down from
the roof and stabbed her with their finger.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.040
With their finger?

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:38.450
It's okay... I'm fine.

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:39.620
Who were they?

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:43.200
I'm not sure. They were
covering their face with a mask.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:47.910
But it looked like they were wearing
a battle uniform supplied by the tower...

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.370
Like a Stabber's...

00:04:59.080 --> 00:04:59.910
Where'd they go?

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.040
They ran off.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:04.450
Towards the city.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:05.660
Wait!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.580
I won't! I'm going after them!

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:10.000
And I'm telling you not to!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.000
It seems like you might know
who it is, but I told you...

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.620
If you cause any more trouble here,

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.290
the elders aren't going to let it slide.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.250
Hell if I care! I'm--

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:22.870
You refuse to listen to me?

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:26.330
I'll go after them. You look after Claiomh.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.660
But they're an assassin from the tower.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:32.910
I'm pretty sure I can handle
a third-rate Stabber that has the nerve

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.500
to attack a girl and run away.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.790
I know how strong you are, Tish, but...

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.580
But what?

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:44.160
This is my home.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.870
This is the only place
that gives me peace of mind.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.660
So I have to protect it.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.330
Don't worry. I'll fix her right up.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:10.950
Honestly, it takes so little
for Krylancelo to lose control.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.370
They're trying to lure me over?

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:23.870
I probably shouldn't go after them alone, but...

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.830
I repair thee, Scars of the Sunset.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:45.000
Orphen! Where are you going?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.910
You're going after Tish, aren't you?

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:48.580
I'll go with you, too!

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:52.950
Majic, keep an eye on her
to make sure she doesn't follow me.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.410
I should be able to
handle one of them on my own.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:50.160
Guess our date spot's
going to be decided by them.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.870
So you did follow them up here alone...

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:20.120
You poor fool.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.500
What did you say?

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:27.540
I'm saying that I feel sorry for you
that you actually came here on your own.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.160
Hydrant!

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:33.870
It can't be... I didn't
sense his presence at all.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:38.620
If possible, I was hoping you'd
manage to have Krylancelo on your tail.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:42.160
I was hoping I could capture him
then strike a deal with you,

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:46.500
but not that any of this matters in the end.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.700
Hey, quit rambling.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:53.160
Well, we're going to have
to interrogate her anyway, Swaine.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:56.830
Swaine?! From the Uoar Class?

00:08:56.830 --> 00:09:00.620
If you tell us what we want
to know, we won't harm you.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.290
What are you two after?

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:06.160
The Browning Family's... world.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.330
World?

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.040
You don't know?

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:14.410
Well, even if you don't know,
I'm sure that one of you do...

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:18.580
One of us? Are you talking
about the Childman Class?

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:21.200
Well... Pretty much.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.830
You won't get me to talk that easily.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:28.000
No one said anything about this going easily.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.620
O Flames!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:42.160
I guess they don't call you
Death Keening for nothing!

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.580
Hark, O Light!

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.700
Don't let her use Sorcery!

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:48.950
Go for her throat!

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:53.620
Hark, O Light!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.370
Good instincts.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:16.410
Though it looks like you've lost some fingers.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.580
This will all be pointless if we let her die.

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.660
Like she'd die that easily.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.410
This is nothing compared to the pain I endured!

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:27.120
Well, take that out with
the person who did that to you.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.410
What are you going to do about the deal?

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:30.370
Tch.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:32.160
We're taking her.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:35.750
I know. We'll use her as bait and--

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:40.620
Sorry, I can't let you have her.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.910
You're...

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:46.120
It couldn't be... You're alive?

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.200
In the past,

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:52.450
I would've probably just thought it'd
be inevitable to have to hand her over,

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:55.370
but considering the situation...

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:59.830
Why... Why are you...

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.250
Let's go.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:17.620
Tish!

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.080
Tish!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.040
Tish...

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.540
Tish...

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:44.660
So you were the one who saved me, Krylancelo...

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:47.370
Y-Yeah...

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:53.620
I was a fool. I actually
mistook your voice for Azalie's.

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:58.450
Is Claiomh all right?

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.080
Yeah. But more importantly,

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:03.580
your fingers have been reattached.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:07.500
Someone... I mean, I was able
to do some emergency treatment,

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.450
so I was able to reattach it.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:14.660
But the nerves were completely cut off, so...

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:18.290
I couldn't repair that
or your scars with Sorcery.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.450
I see...

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.120
Well, no reason to cry about it.

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:24.700
It's what I deserve, I guess.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:27.040
I'll make them go through the same thing!

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:28.910
Stop that.

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.410
Don't.

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:34.540
Don't think of anything foolish.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:36.500
There's nothing foolish about it!

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:39.250
They had the nerve to harm you!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:45.660
Yes, but it won't make me happy
to lose you instead of me losing two fingers!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:48.450
Then what the hell am I supposed to do?

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.500
Contact Forte.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.540
I don't know exactly
what the Uoar Class is up to,

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:56.580
but they tried to kidnap me and failed.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:00.000
That should be enough to ruin them.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:05.000
Forte will be able to contact
the elders, have Hydrant let go,

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:10.290
and make sure that the
Uoar Class will get what they deserve.

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.290
He'd be more than happy to do it.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:16.040
This is the perfect opportunity
to destroy the Uoar Class, after all.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.200
I'll be fine.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:24.700
I'm sure if Comicron was around,
he would've been able to heal me right away...

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:28.700
When he heard that Comicron had died,

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:33.540
Corgon left the tower without saying a word.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:38.370
Everyone had left the tower before I knew it...

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.370
If you're worried about me, then please...

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:45.660
Don't do anything foolish anymore.

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:50.660
Don't go fighting assassins
on your own or leave the tower.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:55.040
Don't... leave me alone in this town anymore.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:03.750
Where are you going?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.870
Azalie...

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.790
Why did you show up, Azalie?

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.500
What's the big deal?

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:23.950
You're the one who told me
I had my own room here.

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.200
Azalie!

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:31.660
If you're too hard on me,
you're going to lose to Uoar Curlaine.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.200
O Radiance.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.500
You're going to the tower, aren't you?

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:40.620
Going to ask for a messenger?

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:44.120
Even if you did, they might
end up in an unfortunate accident.

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:46.290
Hopefully that'll be the extent of it though.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:48.330
What do you mean?

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.750
It means that they're carrying out
the final step in their plan.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:55.290
They're going to stab all of their enemies.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:59.250
Don't tell me... They couldn't possibly...

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:02.750
I mean, a lot of the elders who felt threatened

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.450
by the Uoar Class were already stabbed.

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:10.330
Though I took care of a lot of
the elders that had sided with Uoar myself.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:13.540
With your Killing Doll?

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:16.910
Then that incident with the elders...

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:21.870
It all happened because now that
Master Childman isn't at the tower,

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:26.330
the Uoar Class is trying
to take over control of the tower.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.290
So it wasn't a personal grudge?

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:33.080
What good is going to come out of
killing the elders who put out an order

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:36.040
to kill me after I turned into a monster now?

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:42.910
Just so you know, the thing they're
after isn't us, who witnessed what happened.

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:45.700
It's the Browning Family's Atlas.

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:48.120
Atlas...?

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:52.830
Let me just ask one thing.
The Browning Family's...

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:56.080
What the hell is that?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:16:02.160
A thousand years ago, one of the
gods that had appeared, Swedenborge,

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:06.500
tried to kill off the other gods,
so they could become the only one.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:10.540
Ever since, he was known as
the Magic King that smites the gods.

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:13.200
The Kimluck Church worshiped the goddesses,

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.450
therefore, they considered
the legend of the Magic King taboo.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:20.500
But the Magic King
had secretly left behind a book.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:26.580
That book was recalled in the Atlas.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:32.370
The Kimluck Church retrieved that
book that was stored in the Atlas Tower

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:34.830
and then, eventually
transferred it somewhere else.

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:39.160
To the most prestigious family of the
heads of the church, the Browning Family.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:43.580
But that book had drifted
from the Browning Family

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:47.000
and eventually ended up in the hands
of the believers of the Dragon Faiths.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:52.120
And the last one known
to have that book... was Childman.

00:16:53.910 --> 00:17:00.290
I was basically Master's private secretary,
so I'd heard about the book.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:04.040
It's said that there are secrets
regarding Magic within that book.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:09.080
And that book is supposed
to be the source of Childman's power.

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:12.870
Meaning, if we're able to obtain the Atlas,

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:16.750
we'll be able to seize control of the tower.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:20.160
So the reason that the Uoar Class
attacked the believers in the Dragon Faiths

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:24.790
and Tish was so that they
could find out where that book was?

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.330
Where is this Atlas?

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.370
What are you going to do if you find out?

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:34.950
What do you think? Just let Uoar
or whoever have the damn book!

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:39.330
That can't happen. We need that book.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:41.580
There's no time for this.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.200
Uoar and his class are going
to make their move tonight.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.290
They can't turn back.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:50.750
They went as far as attacking
a high-ranking Sorcerer like Tish.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.750
If the upper echelon makes
their move tomorrow...

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:56.950
...the Uoar Class will be crushed.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:01.910
Their enemies... And by that,
I mean, Forte, Tish, and you...

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:07.040
Oh, right. Hydrant saw my face,
so I guess I'd be included, too.

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:11.700
They're going to try
to get rid of all of us tonight.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:16.330
The two of us will probably
be able to protect ourselves.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.040
But what about Tish?

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.330
It's hard for me to believe

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.450
that you're actually
worried about Tish's wellbeing.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:30.370
Krylancelo...

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:34.660
Sorry, I wasn't actually serious.

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:38.200
I know that. Of course, I do.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:44.330
You'll do it, won't you? Stab Uoar Curlaine?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:47.540
You're asking me to do
the exact opposite of Tish's request.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:51.500
Well, that's because I understand you.
I'm the only one that does.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.370
And that's exactly why you can manipulate me...

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.410
However you please.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:59.000
But you are at least thankful, aren't you?

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:03.540
Because you had to face your old self,

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:07.040
it seems that you were able
to regain how you used to be.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.750
And the power needed to truly be his successor.

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.620
Nornir's Legacy.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.540
You can transfer through space as you please.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:32.540
And as for where the Atlas is...
Your little student has it.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:34.540
My student?

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:35.830
Majic has it?

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.870
You'll be able to use the Atlas
to strike a deal with Uoar.

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:40.370
Make good use of it.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.750
Well, see you at the tower.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.120
You're always so selfish...

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:54.040
Like you actually understand me!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.410
Like a woman who can truly understand
someone else would kill people!

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:05.790
Does he seriously think no one's going
to hear him when he's screaming like that?

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:08.790
Come to think of it, I think I've seen

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:11.540
that lady somewhere before...

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.120
Claiomh.

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.870
Whoopsies. Did you know I was here?

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:22.370
Are you all right now?

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:24.700
I'm fine.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.660
I mean, compared to Tish...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:31.750
Are you going somewhere again?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.200
I'll go, too!

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:36.950
I'm basically the only one
suited to be your sidekick!

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:38.450
Hey, are you listening to me?!

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:39.950
Master.

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.080
Where did you get that book?

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:47.410
Huh? The other day...
at Master Childman's mansion...

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:53.790
Majic!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.410
Uh, coming!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.620
I found it there.

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:03.040
Damn it, Azalie...
She totally had Majic pick it up.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:04.000
Huh?

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:06.750
There's not much time. Let's go.

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:08.330
I'll go, too!

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:13.250
I mean... I might just
end up being a nuisance...

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:18.330
I mean... Yeah, you two
pretty much are nuisances,

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:20.540
but that's totally fine.

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.750
Huh?

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:26.870
Someone like me needs
nuisances like you and Majic...

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:33.160
Or rather, anchors. Otherwise, who knows
where the hell I'll get washed away to?

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:38.200
So, where are we going?
Not that you'd actually tell us.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.450
The Tower of Fangs.

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:40.330
Huh?

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:42.250
What are we going to do there?

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:45.160
I'm sure that's going
to be a secret, too, but...

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:49.080
I'm gonna go fight the
bastards that did that to Tish.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:50.750
What?

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:51.910
Just because you're answering me

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:55.540
doesn't mean that I condone
you running off doing everything yourself!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.290
Just remember that I'm your sidek--

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.700
Yeah. I can't do this on my own.

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:01.370
What?!

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:06.200
And that's why, just this once,
I need you guys to help me out.

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:38.910
Okay, let's do this!

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:42.950
If I'm not physically strong enough,
I'll just have to get more violent!

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:46.950
I think I might be more worried
about you than the Uoar Class...

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:46.980
"Come to My Tower, Successor"
